        <argsstring>(void)</argsstring>
        <name>clkGen_configure</name>
        <param>
          <type>void</type>
        </param>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Applies the board configuration to the clock generator. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Selects the bus segment, loads the base configuration with <ref refid="boardConfig_8h_1a111b8a713c2d0f06282fcae94c19f9b2" kindref="member">BOARD_CLKGEN_SRC</ref> and applies frequency, format and enable state of OUT0/OUT2/OUT4/OUT7 in a single commit.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="return"><para><ref refid="clkGen_8h_1a741a7ac92ad0427448cf8e1c10365814a44a909ad43fd05f0de8fbc4fec204604" kindref="member">CLKGEN_OK</ref> on success, <ref refid="clkGen_8h_1a741a7ac92ad0427448cf8e1c10365814a340f0730d045e6587548f9f415bc6c84" kindref="member">CLKGEN_E_INIT</ref> if not initialized, <ref refid="clkGen_8h_1a741a7ac92ad0427448cf8e1c10365814a255e126dd4705d8bb6cfc9c1bcd42749" kindref="member">CLKGEN_E_BUS</ref> on a bus-switch error, <ref refid="clkGen_8h_1a741a7ac92ad0427448cf8e1c10365814aa2c97a9768a1ba0633678f8981f7d96f" kindref="member">CLKGEN_E_DEVICE</ref> on a device error (e.g. unsupported frequency). </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
