    <briefdescription>
<para>Clock generator function group (si5332). </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Owns the device handle and applies the configuration defined by the BOARD_CLKGEN_* macros in <ref refid="boardConfig_8h" kindref="compound">boardConfig.h</ref>. OUT6 (25 MHz CMOS system clock) is fixed in hardware and always enabled. </para>
